#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:6
#: 3592ad039fe14ef2a87538e15912525a
msgid "DisplayPort, is an MSP protocol extension that allows an autopilot to remotely draw text on compatible external OSDs. DisplayPort, is an MSP protocol extension that allows to remotely draw text characters/icons on compatible external OSDs and allows High Definition (HD) as well as Standard Definition (SD) displays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:8
#: e114f07d52da4d17ac60613b39b2be62
